"primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "84754367", "author": {"steamid": "76561198055282987", "personaname": "pvt TOAST", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198055282987/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 133383, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3838, "last_played": 1765557913, "avatar": "3ca0cd38a9429b4d7fe0a5f2e566f4aab606eb48"}, "language": "english", "review": "Finally the fps ive been looking for. Keeps track of every round in every mag. Calculates trajectory and penetration with some terminal ballistics in play. You have to zero your optics. Get waaay far away from claymores when you place them. Also brings fear of dying (in game) because there is no auto respawn close by. You either have to hoof it out or get a 10 minute ride from base from a real human pilot. No CS or CoD tactics here. No jumping headshots with dual deagles. Real team guys using real team tactics is mandatory. Combat from all sides at all ranges is the norm in every situation. If youre bored of linear fps, this is your game. Most Epic!", "timestamp_created": 1610750852, "timestamp_updated": 1610750852, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "84752684", "author": {"steamid": "76561198929578897", "personaname": "Super", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/super26dawg/", "num_games_owned": 87, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 3331, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1117, "last_played": 1639261572, "avatar": "e662c9286c3efbfa6b5b3cdd958c3f9256899daf"}, "language": "english", "review": "Its fun", "timestamp